(48, 'QTN00104052026A', 8491, 5000, '<p>Greeting from PROGRAMERS !!</p>\n\n<p>Dear sir,<br />\nWith reference to the direct conversation had with you regarding the Website designing &nbsp; I hereby sending our best proposal for your website design with implementing by using the latest technology.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><em><strong>WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT QUOTATION</strong></em></p>\n\n<p><br />\nClient: Mihira Educational Charity Foundation<br />\n1. Project Overview<br />\nThis quotation outlines the development of a complete, responsive, and user-friendly website for the Mihira Educational Charity Foundation.<br />\nThe website will also include complete details of Kadha School for Kids, which operates under the Foundation.<br />\nThe site will highlight the Foundation&rsquo;s activities, school programs, publications, upcoming events, competition results, and allow franchise enquiries.<br />\nScope of Work</p>\n\n<p>Website pages</p>\n\n<p>#Home &ndash; Overview of the Foundation &amp; Highlights&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 6000<br />\n# About the Foundation &ndash; Vision, Mission, History&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 44555<br />\n#Kadha School for Kids &ndash; School Details, Programs, Facilitie&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 78878<br />\n#News &amp; Events &ndash; To publish upcoming &amp; past programs&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;67676<br />\n#Competition Results &ndash; Admin can upload results&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;67676<br />\n#Publications &ndash; Display the books released by the Foundation<br />\n#Franchise Enquiry &ndash; Form for franchise applications<br />\n#Gallery &ndash; Photos and Videos (Optional)<br />\n#Contact Us</p>\n\n<p>Key Website Features</p>\n\n<p># Modern and responsive design for all devices<br />\n#Professional educational theme<br />\n#Admin Panel to easily update:<br />\n#News &amp; Events<br />\n#Competition Results<br />\n#Publications (Books)<br />\n#Franchise Enquiry Form with email notifications<br />\n#Secure backend for data managemen<br />\n#Social Media Integration<br />\n#Google Map Integration<br />\n#Basic SEO (search engine optimization)<br />\n#Option for WhatsApp contact button<br />\n#Fast-loading optimized pages<br />\nYour website will be designed and hosted by mobile view format,responsive design with latest technology ( mobile view) along with the Google map, and social media links.further please revert back to me after your review.<br />\nPayment:50 % advance and balance completion of works.&nbsp;<br />\nDelivery: &nbsp;Will be within 30 days. all the content needs to be provided by your end.<br />\nHope you have understand the proposal in case you may have any technical queries do not hesitate to contact me.</p>\n\n<h1><strong><s>Best Regards&nbsp;<br />\nHusna M S&nbsp;<br />\nManager - Marketing&nbsp;<br />\n9495951442<br />\nsales@programers.in</s></strong></h1>\n', '', 500, 'abcd', '$', 'asdaf', 'dgfg', 'abcdert', 4, 0, 2, 'Husna', '2026-08-18', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2026-05-04 13:02:04', '2026-05-04 13:11:08', NULL, 0, ''),
(49, 'QTN848520052026B', 8485, 15000, '<p>To, &nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 17th April 2026&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe Secretary/President&nbsp;<br />\r\nCheraman Juma Masjid, Kodungallur, Thrissur<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nSub: - Website Redesign Quotation Cheraman Juma Masjid. (www.cheramanjumamasjid.com)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dear Sir,&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nThis quotation is prepared for the website redesign with dynamic features for Cheraman Juma Masjid (www.cheramanjumamasjid.com). The goal is to create a clean, modern, and easy-to-manage website that reflects the Masjid&rsquo;s heritage while enabling easy content updates.&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nDomain + Server&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nDomian And Server Registration for one year Cost: Already registered (No Payment)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SSL (Server Security Licence)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SSL Certificate Cost: &nbsp;(additional)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pages Included&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Home&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;About Masjid (History &amp; Significance)&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Prayer Timings&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Announcements / News&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Welfare&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Constitution&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;o &nbsp; &nbsp;Mahallu Constitution&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;o &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Cheraman Charitable Society &ndash; General Body Updates&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Visitors&rsquo; Gallery&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nb