ion of the domain, irrespective of the site hosting date. The renewal charges for the website includes domain renewal and server space charges is to be paid 30 days before expiry date of the domain. The rates for domain renewal and server space may change if ICANN makes a change in their charges or as per the change in Currency rates of Indian Rupees with US Dollars. &nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nTaxes and Duties: &nbsp;<br />\r\nThe total price for the contract does not include any taxes or other fees payable to the government. If the government in the future levies any tax, fee or other outgoings, the same shall have to be borne by the client.&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nI accepted the order amount, and terms &amp;conditions &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;I accepted the order amount, and terms &amp; conditions &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\n1st Party &nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe Secretary/President&nbsp;<br />\r\nCheraman Juma Masjid,&nbsp;<br />\r\nKodungallur, Thrissur<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2nd Party &nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nHusna M S<br />\r\nPROGRAMERS, Rd North, Thrissur &nbsp;<br />\r\nMob. 9495951442, 9446451442</p>\r\n', '', 500, 'Social Media', 'INR', 'Test remarks', 'Bincy', 'BIncy', 2, 0, 0, 'Husna', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', '8464846e024c0c8e7804b486537db4b75857a43d5a728eb5b3a394ebbec9166a', '', '', '', '2026-05-20 11:01:25', NULL, NULL, 0, ''),
