(61, 'QTN370809062026A', 3708, 48000, '<p>To,&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe Managing Director<br />\r\nAthul Energy, Thrissur</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nSub: - Website Redesign &amp; Modernization Proposal&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nProject Description<br />\r\nThis quotation is submitted for the redesign and modernization of the existing Athul Energy&nbsp;website, originally developed in 2019.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThe proposed work includes upgrading the website with a modern, responsive, and userfriendly design while retaining all existing functionalities and dynamic management features.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nScope of Work</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n# Website Pages Included</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n* Home<br />\r\n* About Us<br />\r\n* Services<br />\r\n* Testimonials<br />\r\n* News &amp; Events<br />\r\n* Downloads<br />\r\n* Contact Us</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nExisting Dynamic Features Included<br />\r\n1. Downloads Management Section<br />\r\n2. Client Logo Management<br />\r\n3. News &amp; Events Management</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nRedesigning Cost: 48000/-</p>\r\n', '', 0, 'Telecalling', 'INR', '', 'Darsana', 'Husna', 1, 0, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2026-06-09 16:50:23', '2026-06-09 16:56:17', NULL, 0, ''),
(64, 'QTN383920062026A', 3839, 26000, '<p>Greetings From Programers!!!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dear Sir,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are delighted to submit a quotation for Dummy company, comprising the following modules:<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\n1. Stock Management<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Sales<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Purchase<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Sales Return&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Purchase Return<br />\r\n2. Quotation (Edit/Revise option)<br />\r\n3. Order form Designing&nbsp;<br />\r\n4. Reports<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-Sales&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-Purchase<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-Sales Return&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-Purchase Return&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-Reorder Level&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>*Subscription Plan:*<br />\r\n- Monthly Subscription: 25000/-&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We look forward to the opportunity to work with you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank You &amp; Best Regards</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Best regards,<br />\r\nKarthika</p>\r\n', '', 1000, 'Test', 'INR', 'Test remarks', 'Karthika', 'Husna', 4, 0, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2026-06-20 15:59:52', NULL, NULL, 0, ''),
(65, 'QTN366424062026A', 3664, 7500, '<p>Greeting From PROGRAMERS!!</p>\n\n<p>Dear Sir,</p>\n\n<p>We appreciate the opportunity to present this proposal for designing and developing a professional, modern, and responsive website tailored to meet the needs of your construction business. The goal is to help you stand out in a competitive market by establishing a digital presence that builds trust, showcases your portfolio, and converts leads into clients.</p>\n\n<p>Domain &amp; Server Registration : 7500</p>\n\n<p>Suggested Pages:</p>\n\n<p>Home<br />\nAbout Us<br />\nServices (e.g., Residential, Commercial, Renovations)<br />\nProjects/Portfolio<br />\nClient Testimonials<br />\nContact Us (with form, map, and contact details)</p>\n\n<p>Husna M S<br />\nManager-Marketing<br />\n9999999999 - dummy@programers.in</p>\n', '', 500, 'dummy source', 'INR', 'Test remarks', 'Bincy', 'Husna', 1, 0, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2026-06-24 11:59:09', NULL, NULL, 0, ''),
(66, 'QTN366524062026A', 3665, 20000, '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To,&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 19th June 2026</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Managing Director</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nambeesans Lakshmi Lodge, Thriprayar, Thrissur</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sub: - Website Redesign Quotation<strong> </strong>Nambeesans Lakshmi Lodge</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Domain + Server + SSL Cost&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Domian And Server Registration for one year Cost: Already registered</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SSL Certificate Cost INR 3500: NA</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Website Development &ndash; Static</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>We propose to design and develop a professional, mobile-friendly website for Nambeesans Lakshmi Lodge.</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Features Included:</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Home Page</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* About Us</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Facilities</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Gallery</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>* Tarrif</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Restaurants</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Contact Page</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Restaurant page/section will be developed as a Dynamic page for easy image updates.</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Pricing</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Website Development: ₹20,000&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Discount&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : ₹2,000&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Final Amount&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ₹18,000</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Google Business Profile Management</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Management of 2 Google Business Profiles including:</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Profile Updates</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Photo Uploads</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Review Monitoring</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Performance Optimization</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Monthly Charge: ₹5,000</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><em>Terms &amp; Conditions</em></strong><strong><em>&nbsp; </em></strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Support: </strong>Full support will be provided to you via Internet, Email, Phone to start running of existing website. (not related Data) Product License:&nbsp; Installation in one server only.<strong> </strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Delivery: </strong>Within 20 days from the Order Date <strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Payment:&nbsp; 75</strong>% advance should be made on signing of contract and balance 25% will be 1st demo of the software.&nbsp; All the payments should be done through Demand draft or Cheque payable to &ldquo;PROGRAMERS &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>International, Thrissur. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Renewal Of Server space/hosting: </strong>In addition to the AMC, yearly domain and database, server space renewal amount to be paid in Advance., 1 GB dedicated Server Space high speed c3 Server with Limited Bandwidth (Approximately 250MB), Database &ndash; MySQL- excluding the tax) The charges for server space will be started on the day of registration of the domain, irrespective of the site hosting date. The renewal charges for the website includes domain renewal and server space charges is to be paid 30 days before expiry date of the domain. The rates for domain renewal and server space may change if ICANN makes a change in their charges or as per the change in Currency rates of Indian Rupees with US Dollars. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Taxes and Duties:</strong> &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The total price for the contract does not include any taxes or other fees payable to the government. If the government in the future levies any tax, fee or other outgoings, the same shall have to be borne by the client.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 2000, '18000', 'INR', 'TEST', 'DARSANA', 'HUSNA', 1, 0, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2026-06-24 14:02:16', NULL, NULL, 0, ''),
