(75, 'QTN692711082026A', 6927, 1000, '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>*Greeting from PROGRAMERS !!*</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With reference to the telephonic conversation had with you regarding the Website designing &nbsp; I hereby sending our best proposal for your &nbsp;website &nbsp; design with implementing by using the latest technology.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Your website will be designed and hosted by mobile view format, &nbsp;further please revert back to me after your review.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n*Hosting :*</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Domain : 1000<br />\r\nDedicated Server:2000<br />\r\nSSL: 3500 (optional)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>*Web design layout and static* :</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Home<br />\r\nAbout us<br />\r\nGallery&nbsp;<br />\r\nTestimonials&nbsp;<br />\r\nContact us</p>\r\n\r\n<p>responsive design with latest technology ( mobile view) along with the Google map, and the existing social media links &nbsp;( news links creations Rs.1500 will be additional) &nbsp;. Thr product page will be posted only statically maximum 10 product image . More images will be chargeable. This site will be designed in statically only.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>*Web designing cost &nbsp;Amount Rs.6500*</p>\r\n\r\n<p>*Total cost &nbsp;: 9500*</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nPayment:50 % advance and balance completion of works.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>delivery: &nbsp;will be within 30 days. all the content needs to be provided by your end.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>AMC: Rs.450 will be charged by monthly for maintenance of website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<br />\r\nHope you have understand the proposal in case you may have any technical queries do not hesitate to contact me.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our bank details&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Company &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: PROGRAMERS&nbsp;<br />\r\nBank Name&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; : ICICI BANK&nbsp;<br />\r\nAccount number&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; : 018005500271<br />\r\nIFSC CODE&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; : ICIC0000180<br />\r\nBANK : ICICI BANK , Thrissur Main Brach</p>\r\n\r\n