(107, 8700, 2, 'A report section in a website is used to present important information in a clear and organized manner for users or administrators. It can include details such as sales data, user activity, project progress, attendance, analytics, or performance summaries. A well-designed website report should contain headings, tables, charts, and brief explanations so that users can easily understand the information. Modern websites often provide downloadable reports in PDF or Excel format and allow filtering by date, category, or user. Reports are commonly used in business websites, school management systems, hospital portals, e-commerce platforms, and admin dashboards to help track records, analyze performance, and support decision-making.\r\n', '2027-02-03 00:00:00', '2026-05-22 07:48:01', '2026-05-22 07:48:01'),
